                                            "A tight-fitting one-piece garment worn by women and girls."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c5f9665-fb34-4896-920c-d9c93ea0e1e2",
                                                "sense_id": "4e26e373-5241-3ec2-b6ed-1bdc58f34b50",
                                                "text": "Jade refused to go swimming with her brother until he helped her find her favorite swimsuit."
                                            }
                                        ]
